ible;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          到现在，Rumudamo合作的咖农已经超过300户，管理的种植面积已经过1000公顷。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0em;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0em;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SIDRj7OdMiaO0ZWljx1IGj50TtHQQXULyeD7NK3bJE1P4aQN8qoDfYdCqfZUhwnrlYmwAwKGpS8yw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"outline: 0px;display: initial;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible !important;width: 578px;height: 327px;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0em;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\n          Arbegona属于Sidama A分类下\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           关于本批次处理方式\n          </span>\n</strong>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          采摘成熟的咖啡果，鲜果去皮后，在发酵罐中发酵48小时后清洗干净残留的果胶，然后在非洲晒床上晾晒7-8天。\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         